span><span begin="00:37.650" end="00:38.370">get </span><span begin="00:38.370" end="00:39.090">these </span><span begin="00:39.090" end="00:40.230">pills </span><span begin="00:40.230" end="00:40.410">to </span><span begin="00:40.410" end="00:42.780">swallow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.290" end="00:45.600"><span begin="00:43.290" end="00:44.100">How </span><span begin="00:44.100" end="00:44.730">they </span><span begin="00:44.730" end="00:45.600">stick</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.170" end="00:48.750"><span begin="00:46.170" end="00:46.800">In </span><span begin="00:46.800" end="00:47.580">your </span><span begin="00:47.580" end="00:48.750">throat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.750" end="00:54.360"><span begin="00:51.750" end="00:52.530">Tastes </span><span begin="00:52.530" end="00:53.220">like </span><span begin="00:53.220" end="00:54.360">gold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.600" end="01:00.300"><span begin="00:57.600" end="00:58.110">Oh</span><span begin="00:58.110" end="00:58.110">, </span><span begin="00:58.110" end="00:58.530">what </span><span begin="00:58.530" end="00:58.740">you </span><span begin="00:58.740" end="00:59.190">do </span><span begin="00:59.190" end="00:59.460">to </span><span begin="00:59.460" end="01:00.300">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.970" end="01:05.700"><span begin="01:02.970" end="01:03.750">No </span><span begin="01:03.750" end="01:04.410">one </span><span begin="01:04.410" end="01:05.700">knows</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.870" end="01:14.940"><span begin="01:09.870" end="01:10.140">And </span><span begin="01:10.140" end="01:10.380">I </span><span begin="01:10.380" end="01:12.390">realize </span><span begin="01:12.390" end="01:13.170">you'e </span><span begin="01:13.170" end="01:14.940">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.450" end="01:20.640"><span begin="01:15.450" end="01:16.800">Indeed </span><span begin="01:16.800" end="01:17.370">a </span><span begin="01:17.370" end="01:18.690">fool </span><span begin="01:18.690" end="01:18.840">of </span><span begin="01:18.840" end="01:20.640">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.120" end="01:26.280"><span begin="01:21.120" end="01:21.420">And </span><span begin="01:21.420" end="01:21.660">I </span><span begin="01:21.660" end="01:23.730">realize </span><span begin="01:23.730" end="01:24.480">you'e </span><span begin="01:24.480" end="01:26.280">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.790" end="01:31.590"><span begin="01:26.790" end="01:28.200">Indeed </span><span begin="01:28.200" end="01:28.740">a </span><span begin="01:28.740" end="01:30.060">fool </span><span begin="01:30.060" end="01:30.210">of </span><span begin="01:30.210" end="01:31.590">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.710" end="01:34.620"><span begin="01:31.710" end="01:34.620">Ahh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.600" end="01:44.430"><span begin="01:39.600" end="01:39.810">I </span><span begin="01:39.810" end="01:41.190">journey </span><span begin="01:41.190" end="01:42.420">through </span><span begin="01:42.420" end="01:42.660">the </span><span begin="01:42.660" end="01:44.430">desert</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.540" end="01:47.550"><span begin="01:45.540" end="01:46.260">Of </span><span begin="01:46.260" end="01:46.920">the </span><span begin="01:46.920" end="01:47.550">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.390" end="01:52.890"><span begin="01:48.390" end="01:49.110">With </span><span begin="01:49.110" end="01:49.890">no </span><span begin="01:49.890" end="01:52.890">hope</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.270" end="01:57.090"><span begin="01:54.270" end="01:54.780">I </span><span begin="01:54.780" end="01:55.620">found </span><span begin="01:55.620" end="01:57.090">low</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.280" end="02:07.290"><span begin="02:02.280" end="02:02.490">I </span><span begin="02:02.490" end="02:03.420">drift </span><span begin="02:03.420" end="02:05.040">along </span><span begin="02:05.040" end="02:05.520">the </span><span begin="02:05.520" end="02:07.290">ocean</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.250" end="02:13.380"><span begin="02:08.250" end="02:08.970">Dead </span><span begin="02:08.970" end="02:11.130">lifeboats </span><span begin="02:11.130" end="02:11.820">in </span><span begin="02:11.820" end="02:12.540">the </span><span begin="02:12.540" end="02:13.380">sun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.440" end="02:22.620"><span begin="02:16.440" end="02:16.740">And </span><span begin="02:16.740" end="02:22.380">come </span><span begin="02:22.380" end="02:22.620">undone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.620" end="02:24.900"><span begin="02:22.620" end="02:23.670">Pleasently </span><span begin="02:23.670" end="02:24.570">caving </span><span begin="02:24.570" end="02:24.900">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.570" end="02:30.570"><span begin="02:27.570" end="02:27.840">I </span><span begin="02:27.840" end="02:28.770">come </span><span begin="02:28.770" end="02:30.570">undone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.860" end="02:39.870"><span begin="02:34.860" end="02:35.100">And </span><span begin="02:35.100" end="02:35.340">I </span><span begin="02:35.340" end="02:37.410">realize </span><span begin="02:37.410" end="02:38.100">you'e </span><span begin="02:38.100" end="02:39.870">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.590" end="02:45.540"><span begin="02:40.590" end="02:41.790">Indeed </span><span begin="02:41.790" end="02:42.330">a </span><span begin="02:42.330" end="02:42.690">fool </span><span begin="02:42.690" end="02:43.800">of </span><span begin="02:43.800" end="02:45.540">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.110" end="02:51.900"><span begin="02:46.110" end="02:46.380">And </span><span begin="02:46.380" end="02:46.650">I </span><span begin="02:46.650" end="02:48.780">realize </span><span begin="02:48.780" end="02:49.500">you'e </span><span begin="02:49.500" end="02:51.900">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.960" end="02:56.550"><span begin="02:51.960" end="02:53.190">Indeed </span><span begin="02:53.190" end="02:53.730">a </span><span begin="02:53.730" end="02:54.210">fool </span><span begin="02:54.210" end="02:55.200">and </span><span begin="02:55.200" end="02:56.550">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.770" end="03:28.680"><span begin="03:19.770" end="03:28.680">Ahhh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:43.080" end="03:48.180"><span begin="03:43.080" end="03:44.520">Heaven </span><span begin="03:44.520" end="03:45.780">smiles </span><span begin="03:45.780" end="03:46.740">above </span><span begin="03:46.740" end="03:48.180">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:48.780" end="03:56.010"><span begin="03:48.780" end="03:49.710">What </span><span begin="03:49.710" end="03:50.340">a </span><span begin="03:50.340" end="03:51.720">gift </span><span begin="03:51.720" end="03:52.440">there </span><span begin="03:52.440" end="03:56.010">below</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:56.910" end="04:00.240"><span begin="03:56.910" end="03:57.270">But </span><span begin="03:57.270" end="03:58.050">no </span><span begin="03:58.050" end="03:58.560">one </span><span begin="03:58.560" end="04:00.240">knows</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:00.240" end="04:06.810"><span begin="04:00.240" end="04:03.150">A </span><span begin="04:03.150" end="04:03.630">gift </span><span begin="04:03.630" end="04:03.960">that </span><span begin="04:03.960" end="04:04.140">you </span><span begin="04:04.140" end="04:04.590">give </span><span begin="04:04.590" end="04:04.830">to </span><span begin="04:04.830" end="04:06.810">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:08.430" end="04:24.960"><span begin="04:08.430" end="04:09.960">No </span><span begin="04:09.960" end="04:24.660">one </span><span begin="04:24.660" end="04:24.960">knows</span></p></div></body></tt>